1200 BM$="Old Man: You must solve the secret of the crest I've given you. You\promised me this as I was dying.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1210 BM$="David: You're the man from my dream...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1220 BM$="Old Man: A dream? Don't be a fool! They killed me right before your eyes.\Now I am forced to roam this world as a spirit, never leaving your side,\until you realize my wish.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
